    They are used solely as labeled test data for the scorer calibration (docs/CALIBRATION.md). If you redistribute this
    repository's test fixtures, check each RFC's own legal notice (manifest.json lists the source URL per file), or
    delete the RFC fixtures and the calibration gate with them.
